NOTICE — third-party STEP files in this crate's test corpus
===========================================================

`tests/fixtures/wild/` holds STEP exchange files that **nobody on this
project authored**. They are the M7-4 wild corpus: real translator
output, kept verbatim (the only edit to each file is a provenance
comment after its `ISO-10303-21;` magic), because their line endings,
column-72 string folds, unit conventions and dialect quirks are the
data the import suite tests.

Each file carries its source URL, license and generator in that
comment. The license texts sit beside the files in each vein
directory. This notice records the acknowledgements those licenses ask
for, and the dispositions under which the files are redistributed.

